 saloon, maybe there will be a daredevil there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set up camp</strong> to heal your wounds, hunt and rest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cities.</strong> Behave calmly and maybe the sheriff will not start shooting first.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A good combination</strong> of a western and card board games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543860/extras/53b5cfc8264d8fc46ff0328459d6517e.poster.avif?t=1774034241\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543860/extras/53b5cfc8264d8fc46ff0328459d6517e.webm?t=1774034241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543860/extras/53b5cfc8264d8fc46ff0328459d6517e.mp4?t=1774034241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the Sheriff's mutts, grab the jackpot and ride off into the carefree sunset? Saddle up your  horses and shoot without a miss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["BillysBones","Grable Team"],"dlc":[4182830],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543860/0ff32fcba76a130261c2b6072774d72b046894d1/header.jpg?t=1774034241","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3543860/275539865/3dd200d60267bf8e867e9310c4bc547a037badef/1761245578/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761287807","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3543860/275539865/3dd200d60267bf8e867e9310c4bc547a037badef/1761245578/dash_h